  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Flames charbroil the length of your arm, fusing muscle, tendons and remains of clothing into a charred mess. Pain quickly fades to numbness as free nerve endings in the skin are devoured by the fire.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (2) and contract a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.kKccDTGzWzSXCBOb]{Festering Wound}. You also suffer a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.qn4ZpvTQIX4rcJDl]{Torn Muscle (Major)} except only partial healing is possible due to the amount of lost muscle and the stiff scar tissue that will replace it.</p>"
    },
